# 29. SCANDRIX RECOMMENDED CLEAN STACK BLUEPRINT
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Architecture : Lean, High-Value, Zero-Bloat Platform Consolidation
# Stack Focus  : Core Go Engine + Supabase + RabbitMQ + Appwrite + Resend
# Business Ops : Zoho Suite (Mail + Bookings + Billing + CRM) (<$1/mo)
# Monitoring   : Sentry (GitHub Student Pack) + PostHog (1M Free Events)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [A] ERROR MONITORING & APM TRACING: SENTRY
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# • Provider : Sentry.io (GitHub Student Developer Pack)
# • Quota    : 500,000+ monthly events & distributed traces (Free)
# • Role     : Captures runtime Go panics, API errors & Next.js hydration issues
# • Portal   : https://sentry.io -> Project Settings -> Client Keys (DSN)
